   "title": "St. Olaf Orchestra at Goshen High School (Goshen, IN)",
   "description": "<div data-modular-content-collection><p>The St. Olaf Orchestra, conducted by Chung Park, will perform at Goshen High School on Sunday, Oct. 11, at 4 p.m. during its fall tour. This year&#8217;s program features Richard Strauss&#8217;s epic <em>Death and Transfiguration</em>, the toe-tapping <em>Danzón</em><em> No. 2</em> by Arturo Márquez, and Brahms’s energetic <em>Hungarian Dance No. 2</em>.</p>\n</div>",
